    "AddRems": "Inhabits soft mud bottoms in fairly deep water (Ref. 9988).  Benthic (Ref. 58426).  Feeds on crustaceans, polychaetes, brittle stars (Ref. 9988) and fishes (Ref. 58426).  It is preyed upon by harp seals.  Parasites of the species include 4 protozoans, 11 trematodes, 6 nematodes, 2 acanthocephalans and 1 copepod (Ref. 5951).  See also Ref. 9000 for diet composition.",
